    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/45600c994c0eb2185f1e3fc0cf339bff.avif?t=1722328670\" width=600 height=68 /></span><br>Step into the boots of the town's fearless pest hunter! Face off against a swarm of creepy crawlies, from relentless roaches to voracious locusts, shrewd spiders and more. It's a cat-and-mouse game where you're the mouse and they're the... well, let's just say you'll need more than just bug spray to survive. Dodge, spray, and strategize your way through hordes of infestations, and DON'T let these bugs climb up your FACE! Can you squash the infestation, or end up getting 'Bugged Out!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/169acb518cafb3019ea7771636f89438.poster.avif?t=1722328670\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/169acb518cafb3019ea7771636f89438.webm?t=1722328670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/169acb518cafb3019ea7771636f89438.mp4?t=1722328670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Features<br>1. Upgradeable bug spray weapon, including... uh, facial moisturizer and deep breathing?<br>2. Variety of common and bizzare otherworldly bug species with unique behavior.<br>3. Shudder at the sound of a bug's flapping wings as it flies close to your face.<br>5. Shake off bugs that are stuck to you using your mouse.<br>6. Multiple locations, from apartment to chalet, office, train station, train, and more.<br>7. This is an insect-horror first-person shooter game.<br>8. For those with entomophobia (fear of insect), you've been warned!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/a289f15b7678b5841de1532448c3a638.avif?t=1722328670\" width=593 height=347 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/45600c994c0eb2185f1e3fc0cf339bff.avif?t=1722328670\" width=600 height=68 /></span><br>Step into the boots of the town's fearless pest hunter! Face off against a swarm of creepy crawlies, from relentless roaches to voracious locusts, shrewd spiders and more. It's a cat-and-mouse game where you're the mouse and they're the... well, let's just say you'll need more than just bug spray to survive. Dodge, spray, and strategize your way through hordes of infestations, and DON'T let these bugs climb up your FACE! Can you squash the infestation, or end up getting 'Bugged Out!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/169acb518cafb3019ea7771636f89438.poster.avif?t=1722328670\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/169acb518cafb3019ea7771636f89438.webm?t=1722328670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/169acb518cafb3019ea7771636f89438.mp4?t=1722328670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Features<br>1. Upgradeable bug spray weapon, including... uh, facial moisturizer and deep breathing?<br>2. Variety of common and bizzare otherworldly bug species with unique behavior.<br>3. Shudder at the sound of a bug's flapping wings as it flies close to your face.<br>5. Shake off bugs that are stuck to you using your mouse.<br>6. Multiple locations, from apartment to chalet, office, train station, train, and more.<br>7. This is an insect-horror first-person shooter game.<br>8. For those with entomophobia (fear of insect), you've been warned!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592470/extras/a289f15b7678b5841de1532448c3a638.avif?t=1722328670\" width=593 height=347 /></span>",
